        "text": "As for this grave/This is a grave, which Ka'b bar Haritat made for Raqash daughter of 'Abd-Manat, his mother. And she died in al-Hijr, year one-hundred-sixty-two, in the month of Tammuz. And may Mare 'Alma [the Lord of the World] curse him who alters this tomb or opens it, save for him whom he has begotten. And may he curse anyone who buries or exhumes anyone else in it.",
